🖥️ Linux Commands - OS Lab
1. 📂 Directory Related Commands

Description:
These commands are used to create, navigate, display, and remove directories in Linux.

Commands Used:

pwd          # Display current working directory
cd           # Change directory
mkdir        # Create a new directory
rmdir        # Remove an empty directory

