2. 📄 File Related Commands

Description:
These commands are used to create, display, copy, rename, move, delete, and sort files.

Commands Used:

cat          # Create and display file contents
cp           # Copy a file
mv           # Move or rename a file
rm           # Remove a file
sort         # Display file contents in sorted order

